Z||000000||doughboySE||11-19-2000||08:15 PM||||ok guys here we go. because im not in the position to fix the old kcar im going to have to drive my baby this winter <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"> i have driven it once before but that was before the 1500.00 paint job. and i swore id never do it again. anyway she is all set greese job and oil change and the rad flushed and ready to roar also had the exhaust tightened and the map sensor replace (wow major gettupandgo now)lights are up and staying there and new tires all around. i do have 1 question.in the summer i hooked my fan up to my driving lights so i could control it myself , only problem is that now being dark all the time my lights are on and so is the fan.will this effect how fast my car will heat up or how it will perform in cold weather? cause the fan is always on?<BR>thanx in advance<BR>oh ya GT dont comment i dont care about my run ons and spelling <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> thanx||||reg||1
